------------------------------------------------------------------------------
--  Title         : Twiddle Factor Package (DIF Q1.14)
--  File Name     : twiddle_dif_q1_14_pkg.vhd
--  Project       : VHDL2: Individual Task
--  Company       : AGSTU AB
--  Engineer      : Harald Fjellström
--
--  Description   :
--    Provides Decimation-in-Frequency (DIF) twiddle factors for FFT 
--    calculations. This is not a synthesis ready design, wide combinatorial
--    net makes it highly unusable in synthesis.
--
--    Note: The constant tables in this package are automatically generated 
--    via a Python script. The factors are stored in Q1.14 fixed-point format.
--
--  Optimization Note:
--    This package could be further improved by utilizing VHDL compile-time 
--    mathematics (using ieee.math_real). By implementing a generation 
--    function within the package body, the tables could be calculated 
--    automatically during elaboration. This would eliminate the need for 
--    external scripts and manual table updates, while still resulting in
--    efficient ROM-based hardware.
--
--  Revision History :
--  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
--   Date        Version   Author               Description
--  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
--   2026-03-05  1.0       Harald Fjellström    Initial release
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
